# Dawn (battlefield.dawn, Empyreal Paradox): enter area 1 (option 1), trigger the exit NPC Transcendental_Radiance:
# the zone data's status is cutscene_only, so the engine refuses the trigger before any script runs (a lone release,
# no 32003), and the update and the finish do nothing. The warp back to the entrance re-enters the battlefield area
# (ENTERING_THE_BATTLEFIELD_FOR again); TR_Entrance: the menu.
uncovered: exit:Transcendental_Radiance -- the three Transcendental_Radiance are cutscene_only (npcs.yaml:108,122,136): the engine refuses the trigger before any script, so Battlefield.onExitTrigger never runs
lists EmpyrealParadox/TR_Entrance/onTrigger EmpyrealParadox/Transcendental_Radiance/onTrigger EmpyrealParadox/onEventUpdate/32000 EmpyrealParadox/onEventFinish/32000 EmpyrealParadox/onEventUpdate/32003 EmpyrealParadox/onEventFinish/32003
char zone=EmpyrealParadox pos=541.5,-1.2,-597.7 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Cop Dawn current
charvar Mission[6][840]Status 1
login
trigger TR_Entrance
update 32000 option=1
finish
trigger Transcendental_Radiance
update 32003 option=1
finish option=4
warp 541.5,-1.2,-597.7 EmpyrealParadox
trigger TR_Entrance
